WEBVTT

00:19.850 --> 00:22.940
<b>So that's our strategy.</b>

00:25.810 --> 00:28.020
<b>Ayako and I will round up
the backup troops</b>

00:28.110 --> 00:30.440
<b>from the village
at the foot of the mountain.</b>

00:31.650 --> 00:33.860
<b>And Genba, you are to immediately return</b>

00:33.950 --> 00:36.620
<b>to Suwa Grand Shrine
and request reinforcements.</b>

00:38.080 --> 00:41.160
<b>I'm leaving the front lines!
I don't have to die.</b>

00:41.250 --> 00:42.580
<b>This guy…</b>

00:42.660 --> 00:44.330
<b>Kids, I want your help too.</b>

00:44.920 --> 00:48.540
<b>I want to set as many traps as possible
before the enemy advances.</b>

00:48.630 --> 00:51.000
<b>-Leave it to us.
-We'll need to gather materials too.</b>

00:51.090 --> 00:53.050
<b>-When battle starts…
-First we should check the traps…</b>

00:53.130 --> 00:56.090
<b>-…we'll safely relocate the children.
-Oh, yeah. We can reuse some of the traps.</b>

00:56.180 --> 00:59.510
<b>-They'll need a guard. I can do it.
-So we'll use what we have already</b>

00:59.600 --> 01:01.600
<b>and make the rest that we need?</b>

01:01.680 --> 01:02.520
<b>Fubuki.</b>

01:02.600 --> 01:05.190
<b>We'll need more traps this time,
so let's increase the amount.</b>

01:05.270 --> 01:07.980
<b>Do you have a minute to spare?</b>

01:28.000 --> 01:28.960
<b>I see.</b>

01:29.040 --> 01:31.250
<b>Your elusiveness is splendid.</b>

01:31.340 --> 01:33.340
<b>Now attack me!</b>

01:41.850 --> 01:43.560
<b>FLAIL</b>

01:44.140 --> 01:45.480
<b>Now I understand.</b>

01:45.560 --> 01:48.150
<b>Your attacks are utter trash.</b>

01:48.730 --> 01:51.400
<b>So you want me
to teach you a sword technique</b>

01:51.480 --> 01:54.690
<b>that even someone like you
could use to kill an enemy.</b>

01:55.490 --> 01:59.740
<b>It's really hurtful that you've summed
me up and finished your meal in one swing!</b>

02:01.580 --> 02:04.540
<b>You're an excellent teacher.</b>

02:04.620 --> 02:07.620
<b>The war council just now was
very easy to understand,</b>

02:07.710 --> 02:09.790
<b>and you seem to know sword fighting well.</b>

02:11.000 --> 02:14.340
<b>Please. I don't want to
just be protected all the time.</b>

02:18.930 --> 02:21.090
<b>You said your name is Chojumaru.</b>

02:21.850 --> 02:23.390
<b>Are you Shizuku's older brother?</b>

02:25.140 --> 02:28.190
<b>That's more of a term of endearment.</b>

02:29.440 --> 02:33.320
<b>The other retainers are fond of you,
and they're devoted to you too.</b>

02:34.780 --> 02:37.280
<b>You must be
from an exceptionally noble family.</b>

02:38.070 --> 02:41.570
<b>No. My parents were Suwa warriors,
but they passed in a fire.</b>

02:42.280 --> 02:45.370
<b>I don't have any relatives,
so Suwa Grand Shrine took me in.</b>

02:46.750 --> 02:49.670
<b>You see, I've never had
martial arts training or anything.</b>

02:49.750 --> 02:52.170
<b>FLOP - WHIP - BING - BOUNCE</b>

02:52.790 --> 02:53.790
<b><i>He's an orphan.</i></b>

02:54.290 --> 02:59.260
<b><i>Perhaps he empathizes with the children</i>
<i>because he experienced similar hardships.</i></b>

03:00.010 --> 03:02.640
<b><i>He doesn't have much going for him</i>
<i>besides his elusiveness,</i></b>

03:02.720 --> 03:06.430
<b><i>but his unexpected warmth in</i>
<i>these turbulent times is a strong weapon.</i></b>

03:07.060 --> 03:08.270
<b>There is something.</b>

03:09.390 --> 03:12.060
<b>There's a secret sword technique
that suits you.</b>

03:12.560 --> 03:14.570
<b>Are you serious?</b>

03:15.190 --> 03:20.200
<b>I didn't think anyone could
intentionally pull off this technique,</b>

03:20.280 --> 03:22.780
<b>but you will master it quickly.</b>

03:23.620 --> 03:28.410
<b>I believe it is the kindest,
most compassionate,</b>

03:28.500 --> 03:30.870
<b>yet cruelest technique.</b>

03:31.670 --> 03:35.090
<b>DEMON-HEART BUDDHA BLADE</b>

03:35.170 --> 03:38.840
<b>Let's call it
the Demon-heart Buddha Blade.</b>

03:40.720 --> 03:42.380
<b>Demon-heart Buddha Blade?</b>

03:43.470 --> 03:47.140
<b>However, this technique can
only be used in a one-on-one match.</b>

03:49.680 --> 03:51.440
<b>Wait, that means…</b>

03:51.520 --> 03:52.600
<b>I should…</b>

03:52.690 --> 03:55.270
<b>No, this way is better…</b>

03:55.360 --> 03:56.360
<b>MUMBLE MUMBLE</b>

03:57.480 --> 03:58.730
<b>It's perfect.</b>

03:59.610 --> 04:01.780
<b>-Chojumaru.
-Yes.</b>

04:01.860 --> 04:05.820
<b>It looks like the enemy's main forces
might invade as soon as tomorrow.</b>

04:06.870 --> 04:09.910
<b>As for you,
you'll fight the enemy general.</b>

04:10.000 --> 04:11.080
<b>Understood!</b>

04:11.910 --> 04:13.710
<b>With the reinforcements Shizuku will bring</b>

04:15.170 --> 04:16.920
<b>and your elusiveness,</b>

04:17.670 --> 04:20.050
<b>it's a heaven-sent chance at victory!</b>

04:20.590 --> 04:23.930
<b>SQUISH</b>

04:26.970 --> 04:29.680
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

05:49.300 --> 05:53.930
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

06:11.780 --> 06:15.250
<b>Right. We've surrounded them
on both fronts.</b>

06:15.330 --> 06:19.120
<b>Sir. Why do we gotta invade
from the mountains</b>

06:19.210 --> 06:22.420
<b>instead of goin' through the entrance?</b>

06:25.210 --> 06:28.470
<b>The fact that our vanguard didn't
come back three separate times means</b>

06:28.550 --> 06:33.010
<b>there are plenty of ambushes or traps
on the most accessible path.</b>

06:35.640 --> 06:40.980
<b>An ambush on difficult terrain may be
more trouble, but it's more secure.</b>

06:41.980 --> 06:43.940
<b>My boss is so smart!</b>

06:44.020 --> 06:45.030
<b>BUDDHA</b>

06:48.110 --> 06:51.110
<b><i>The scoundrels causing a commotion</i>
<i>in this era were warriors who,</i></b>

06:51.200 --> 06:56.500
<b><i>after losing their land, became bandits</i>
<i>and formed their own independent paradise.</i></b>

06:57.200 --> 07:00.620
<b><i>Rich in combat experience,</i>
<i>their war tactics</i></b>

07:00.710 --> 07:04.500
<b><i>and organizational capabilities</i>
<i>didn't compare to ordinary thieves.</i></b>

07:05.710 --> 07:09.260
<b>Put the mind and body
you've honed as a samurai to use,</b>

07:09.340 --> 07:12.010
<b>and pillage mercilessly.</b>

07:12.970 --> 07:15.760
<b>What a sweet feast for a scoundrel.</b>

07:17.060 --> 07:20.310
<b>Kill the adults and enslave the children.</b>

07:20.390 --> 07:23.480
<b>We shall taste the sweet sake of plunder.</b>

07:23.980 --> 07:25.020
<b>Let's go.</b>

07:29.860 --> 07:30.780
<b>What--</b>

07:31.740 --> 07:33.280
<b>An ambush from the summit?</b>

07:33.370 --> 07:36.580
<b>You bastards!
I'll climb up there and kill you!</b>

07:36.660 --> 07:38.910
<b>Stop. That's what they want.</b>

07:39.000 --> 07:40.000
<b>VILLAGE</b>

07:40.080 --> 07:43.040
<b>They'll shoot us down while we reverse
the army and climb back up.</b>

07:43.130 --> 07:46.420
<b>It's a strategic move to suppress the
enemy when completely outnumbered.</b>

07:46.500 --> 07:48.340
<b>No matter. Advance forward.</b>

07:48.420 --> 07:53.300
<b>With this strategy, they might as well
have admitted that they're outnumbered.</b>

07:53.390 --> 07:55.180
<b>The enemy are few in number.</b>

07:55.260 --> 07:58.310
<b>The battle is over
if we can just occupy the village.</b>

07:59.600 --> 08:00.680
<b>Now…</b>

08:02.390 --> 08:03.650
<b>It's time for war.</b>

08:07.070 --> 08:08.360
<b><i>Ice?</i></b>

08:08.440 --> 08:13.320
<b><i>From a distance it just looks like</i>
<i>flatlands, but the whole field is frozen.</i></b>

08:14.110 --> 08:18.370
<b><i>We dammed up the waterway and flooded</i>
<i>the outer edges of the village.</i></b>

08:18.450 --> 08:21.120
<b><i>This winter is so extremely cold</i>
<i>that Lake Suwa froze over.</i></b>

08:21.210 --> 08:23.960
<b><i>The ice trap is ready in just one night.</i></b>

08:24.040 --> 08:25.130
<b>What are you doing?</b>

08:25.210 --> 08:26.340
<b>Hurry up!</b>

08:27.420 --> 08:28.550
<b>It's not that easy!</b>

08:33.050 --> 08:34.840
<b>The archers at the summit are descending!</b>

08:34.930 --> 08:37.970
<b>This is bad.
They're sniping us off in a cross fire!</b>

08:42.560 --> 08:44.810
<b>-There's your path. Go.
-Yes, sir!</b>

08:51.490 --> 08:53.950
<b>Now a pitfall…</b>

08:54.030 --> 08:56.280
<b>The traps just keep coming
one after the other.</b>

08:56.950 --> 09:00.450
<b><i>The children's traps are</i>
<i>also functioning according to plan.</i></b>

09:00.540 --> 09:02.330
<b>Damn thieves!</b>

09:02.410 --> 09:06.120
<b>They dare desecrate the Suwa Sect's land
that Myojin has gifted.</b>

09:06.630 --> 09:08.540
<b><i>-The Suwa Warriors Shizuku gathered…</i>
-Fujimori, Komatsu!</b>

09:08.630 --> 09:11.550
<b><i>-…are few in number, but they're reliable.</i>
-The enemy is coming from the right!</b>

09:11.630 --> 09:13.550
<b>Go around and be on the defense!</b>

09:14.510 --> 09:18.220
<b><i>We're able to stop the enemy attacks</i>
<i>from both sides, all according to plan.</i></b>

09:19.350 --> 09:22.060
<b><i>It's not impossible</i>
<i>to wipe them out at this rate…</i></b>

09:22.810 --> 09:26.730
<b><i>as long as they're</i>
<i>solely average soldiers.</i></b>

09:29.060 --> 09:32.110
<b>FURAN - SHIRO - BYAKKOTSU
SEIGI PARTY CORE MEMBERS</b>

09:36.950 --> 09:39.370
<b>Don't bother with
your fellow men behind you.</b>

09:39.450 --> 09:43.120
<b>The archers can't annihilate us
in the dark.</b>

09:43.200 --> 09:46.620
<b>Rather, we can keep
the entire enemy army's attention on us.</b>

09:46.710 --> 09:47.710
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

09:50.210 --> 09:54.510
<b>First, we'll go kill the archers
that are guiding the opposing army.</b>

09:54.590 --> 09:58.010
<b>Their entire defense will totally crumble
if they lose their leader.</b>

09:58.090 --> 09:59.970
<b>I won't let you!</b>

10:11.980 --> 10:14.320
<b><i>They pass through the ice</i>
<i>and the pitfall traps</i></b>

10:14.400 --> 10:17.400
<b><i>without panicking one bit,</i>
<i>and easily overwhelm the guards.</i></b>

10:18.070 --> 10:20.320
<b><i>Those four are exceptionally strong.</i></b>

10:21.620 --> 10:25.120
<b><i>Especially that man that can see</i>
<i>the entire state of the battle.</i></b>

10:25.200 --> 10:27.580
<b><i>He must be the general.</i></b>

10:27.660 --> 10:30.000
<b>Hey, what should we do, Fubuki?</b>

10:30.080 --> 10:32.000
<b>We have to stop those four.</b>

10:32.090 --> 10:35.050
<b>No. You guys already have your hands full.</b>

10:35.630 --> 10:38.050
<b>If we divide our forces,
the line of defense will collapse.</b>

10:38.970 --> 10:40.140
<b>Then what shall we do?</b>

10:40.220 --> 10:41.720
<b>Leave it…</b>

10:44.260 --> 10:45.680
<b>to us children.</b>

10:47.390 --> 10:48.810
<b>My eye!</b>

10:51.610 --> 10:54.150
<b><i>Let's get that bald general!</i></b>

10:54.230 --> 10:58.400
<b><i>I'll stop his sword,</i>
<i>and you will deal the final blow!</i></b>

10:58.490 --> 11:00.660
<b><i>No, that's a foolish strategy!</i></b>

11:09.000 --> 11:09.960
<b>You…</b>

11:16.630 --> 11:18.510
<b>Oh, no, kids.</b>

11:19.260 --> 11:24.680
<b>Is it your first time fighting
a warrior in full armor?</b>

11:24.760 --> 11:25.680
<b>Shut up!</b>

11:28.100 --> 11:29.560
<b><i>An armored warrior's swordsmanship</i></b>

11:29.640 --> 11:32.400
<b><i>is completely different from</i>
<i>what we'd expect in the present day.</i></b>

11:32.900 --> 11:35.270
<b><i>This is because they can guard their face</i>
<i>with their helmet,</i></b>

11:35.360 --> 11:37.610
<b><i>their torso with their breastplate,</i>
<i>and forearms with gauntlets.</i></b>

11:38.400 --> 11:40.070
<b><i>The only body parts to vigilantly guard</i></b>

11:40.150 --> 11:42.200
<b><i>are the slight openings</i>
<i>between their armor.</i></b>

11:42.950 --> 11:44.120
<b>Right here!</b>

11:52.460 --> 11:55.340
<b>Are you done yet, kids?</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:59.550
<b>Don't worry. I don't kill children.</b>

12:00.800 --> 12:03.890
<b>All that we'll do is take
your teeth and tongue out nicely,</b>

12:03.970 --> 12:07.970
<b>gently slice the tendon in your right leg,
and make you slaves.</b>

12:08.060 --> 12:10.600
<b>I won't do anything other than that.</b>

12:10.680 --> 12:12.350
<b><i>This guy.</i></b>

12:12.440 --> 12:14.810
<b><i>He's an irredeemable demon.</i></b>

12:19.320 --> 12:20.530
<b>Don't be scared!</b>

12:20.610 --> 12:23.700
<b>You kids will be worth
a total of three kanmon.</b>

12:23.780 --> 12:27.200
<b>You don't want to become three kanmon?</b>

12:28.990 --> 12:32.790
<b><i>Once you've gotten a sense of the enemy</i>
<i>general's swordsmanship, please run away.</i></b>

12:33.920 --> 12:36.790
<b><i>If you think you can outsmart him,</i>
<i>lure him into that house.</i></b>

12:44.840 --> 12:45.970
<b>What's this?</b>

13:12.040 --> 13:15.170
<b>My lord, we're leaving,
but you better not die!</b>

13:15.750 --> 13:17.540
<b>Okay. Thank you.</b>

13:21.170 --> 13:23.970
<b>I wonder if our lord will be okay
by himself.</b>

13:24.050 --> 13:27.680
<b>Maybe the three of us should take him on.</b>

13:27.760 --> 13:29.100
<b>Considering the current situation,</b>

13:29.180 --> 13:31.640
<b>we don't have the luxury
of fighting three-on-one.</b>

13:31.720 --> 13:34.520
<b>Plus, with the plan
that Fubuki has devised,</b>

13:34.600 --> 13:37.730
<b>it'll be easier for the Young Lord
to defeat him on his own.</b>

13:37.810 --> 13:41.610
<b>Everything Fubuki says
and does is convincing.</b>

13:41.690 --> 13:44.400
<b>The battle is going
almost exactly as he predicted.</b>

13:45.700 --> 13:50.330
<b>He's a great teacher,
and his swordsmanship is excellent too.</b>

13:51.450 --> 13:54.160
<b>He's overflowing with talent.</b>

13:55.460 --> 13:57.460
<b>That Fubuki.</b>

14:00.960 --> 14:04.380
<b>I guess it's time
for me to join the fight.</b>

14:05.880 --> 14:08.550
<b>Which one of you should I kill first?</b>

14:08.640 --> 14:11.220
<b>Today's war is so fun.</b>

14:41.840 --> 14:45.510
<b>Impressive! I've been trapped!</b>

14:45.590 --> 14:47.720
<b>And all those traps outside the village…</b>

14:47.800 --> 14:50.930
<b>Even Kusunoki would be thrilled
by this defense tactic!</b>

14:51.010 --> 14:52.010
<b>Kusunoki?</b>

14:52.100 --> 14:53.850
<b>By the way, two kanmon (boy),</b>

14:53.930 --> 14:56.730
<b>you're not planning
on facing me by yourself, are you?</b>

14:56.810 --> 14:58.810
<b>-What are you saying--
-Yes.</b>

14:58.890 --> 15:01.980
<b>Your quality is higher
than the two kids from earlier.</b>

15:02.060 --> 15:04.730
<b>You will fetch two kanmon on your own.</b>

15:05.730 --> 15:10.030
<b>Wait. If I teach you a skill,
you could go up to three kanmon.</b>

15:10.780 --> 15:14.200
<b>What is a cheap and easy trick I can teach
in a short amount of time?</b>

15:14.280 --> 15:15.580
<b><i>This man…</i></b>

15:15.660 --> 15:19.540
<b><i>Even though he's been trapped,</i>
<i>it doesn't seem to bother him at all.</i></b>

15:19.620 --> 15:21.540
<b><i>In fact, he's started to appraise me.</i></b>

15:25.340 --> 15:26.710
<b>I want to ask one thing.</b>

15:28.090 --> 15:29.680
<b>Were you the one who gave the order</b>

15:29.760 --> 15:32.050
<b>to slaughter the parents
of the village children?</b>

15:32.550 --> 15:33.850
<b>Certainly, it was me.</b>

15:33.930 --> 15:36.010
<b>Why would you do something so cruel?</b>

15:36.600 --> 15:40.230
<b>Even slave-handling brutes spare
the mother, don't they?</b>

15:42.060 --> 15:43.560
<b>That's a good question.</b>

15:43.650 --> 15:45.440
<b>Four kanmon. (Boy.)</b>

15:47.280 --> 15:50.650
<b>When I slaughter the parents,
I feel elated for that moment.</b>

15:50.740 --> 15:54.950
<b>When I kill the parents and sell off
the kid, the elation lasts much longer.</b>

15:56.450 --> 15:59.540
<b>These children have to suffer hell
for the rest of their lives.</b>

15:59.620 --> 16:03.710
<b>The peace and freedom they enjoyed
under their parents will never return.</b>

16:04.540 --> 16:06.210
<b>How I pity them.</b>

16:06.300 --> 16:09.550
<b>A pitiful life of despair.</b>

16:14.340 --> 16:17.010
<b>When I think about these things
as I sell kids off,</b>

16:17.100 --> 16:20.230
<b>buy sake with that money and get drunk,</b>

16:20.310 --> 16:25.770
<b>it slowly fills my heart with joy,
and I enjoy the most pleasant drunkenness.</b>

16:29.610 --> 16:31.070
<b>I understand well.</b>

16:31.990 --> 16:34.240
<b>You're a demon to the core.</b>

16:34.320 --> 16:36.580
<b>I can kill you with no remorse.</b>

16:37.580 --> 16:38.580
<b>It's a duel.</b>

16:39.540 --> 16:42.290
<b>The winner takes the loser's future.</b>

16:42.960 --> 16:44.710
<b>It's what you're good at, right?</b>

16:46.000 --> 16:47.460
<b>You're a brave child.</b>

16:48.210 --> 16:49.210
<b>What's your name?</b>

16:49.800 --> 16:51.550
<b>I'm Chojumaru of Suwa Grand Shrine.</b>

16:54.970 --> 16:56.640
<b>Chojumaru. (Boy.) (Four kanmon.)</b>

16:57.300 --> 16:58.970
<b>You keep saying numbers.</b>

17:01.810 --> 17:04.810
<b>Sorry, Chojumaru.</b>

17:07.060 --> 17:10.530
<b>For this moment,
I will respect your bravery</b>

17:10.610 --> 17:14.400
<b>and regard you as a warrior,
not a commodity.</b>

17:16.990 --> 17:17.990
<b>What is your name?</b>

17:18.080 --> 17:24.540
<b>I've changed my name many times,
but right now, I go by Shokan.</b>

17:25.870 --> 17:28.290
<b>Surely it will be special…</b>

17:30.750 --> 17:33.550
<b>The sake I'll buy
with the money I get for you!</b>

17:33.630 --> 17:34.630
<b>NANBOKUCHO GAME OF TAG</b>

17:34.720 --> 17:36.050
<b>DEMON OF DISBELIEF
SHOKAN THE HERETIC</b>

17:38.800 --> 17:41.680
<b>Look here! This brat's got nothin' on us!</b>

17:41.770 --> 17:44.100
<b>I can take him on by myself.</b>

17:44.180 --> 17:47.600
<b>Hurry up and kill him
so we can find our boss.</b>

17:55.740 --> 17:56.740
<b>Over here.</b>

18:00.530 --> 18:02.370
<b>I guess the same trick won't work twice.</b>

18:03.450 --> 18:06.620
<b>Pip-squeak. Where's our boss?</b>

18:06.710 --> 18:10.880
<b>I saw him surrounded by our soldiers
and crying pathetically.</b>

18:10.960 --> 18:15.630
<b>You could go see him if you beat us,
but I doubt you can.</b>

18:20.430 --> 18:23.520
<b>You want people
to treat you like an adult?</b>

18:23.600 --> 18:27.940
<b>You're ten years too early, brats.
Now die!</b>

18:29.650 --> 18:32.770
<b>Reckless, so reckless.
You brats are too damn reckless!</b>

18:32.860 --> 18:36.570
<b>My man Shiro is
the strongest in the Seigi Party!</b>

18:39.620 --> 18:42.950
<b>Hey, where do you think you're going?
Are you gonna run away?</b>

18:43.040 --> 18:44.830
<b>Chicken.</b>

18:46.830 --> 18:49.790
<b>No, I realized something
while we were fighting.</b>

18:50.380 --> 18:52.420
<b>It seems you don't want
your allies to see this,</b>

18:52.500 --> 18:54.170
<b>so I thought we would go
somewhere more isolated.</b>

18:54.250 --> 18:56.300
<b>What the hell are you talking about?</b>

18:58.970 --> 19:00.050
<b>It's you, right?</b>

19:00.930 --> 19:04.060
<b>The strongest person out of you thieves.</b>

19:06.890 --> 19:10.310
<b>BUDDHA</b>

19:26.120 --> 19:29.330
<b>You sure are good at evading, Chojumaru.</b>

19:29.410 --> 19:32.000
<b>Want me to guess your strategy?</b>

19:32.080 --> 19:37.510
<b>You're running around this cramped room,
hoping my sword will get stuck somewhere.</b>

19:38.170 --> 19:39.630
<b>You underestimate me.</b>

19:39.720 --> 19:43.760
<b>An indoor fight is a specialty
for thieves who invade homes.</b>

19:43.850 --> 19:48.810
<b>I won't make a mistake as long as I switch
out my long sword for this short one.</b>

19:48.890 --> 19:55.150
<b>All in all, nothing threatens
my heavy armor in this small room.</b>

19:56.150 --> 19:59.240
<b>Plus, there's no room for you to run.</b>

19:59.740 --> 20:01.910
<b>Your strategy is half-assed.</b>

20:02.490 --> 20:07.290
<b>You've backed yourself
into a corner, Chojumaru!</b>

20:09.080 --> 20:11.040
<b>If at some point
you don't think you can win,</b>

20:11.710 --> 20:14.460
<b>knock over the fire
and escape through the ceiling.</b>

20:14.540 --> 20:17.250
<b>With your agility,
you should be able to just reach it.</b>

20:18.260 --> 20:20.130
<b>There's oil on the floor,</b>

20:20.220 --> 20:23.300
<b>so you may be able
to burn him alive if luck is on our side.</b>

20:23.390 --> 20:25.470
<b>But this is a backup plan.</b>

20:25.970 --> 20:31.640
<b>The best scenario is if you could
defeat him with your own skills.</b>

20:33.520 --> 20:35.900
<b>Can I really slay him?</b>

20:36.570 --> 20:41.150
<b>It feels like the harder I try,
the weaker my swings become.</b>

20:42.450 --> 20:45.910
<b>You're misunderstanding
how to use a sword.</b>

20:47.490 --> 20:49.910
<b>Your weapon is your kindness.</b>

20:51.040 --> 20:53.370
<b>You're better at running than fighting.</b>

20:53.460 --> 20:55.630
<b>Better at pulling than pushing.</b>

20:55.710 --> 20:58.340
<b>Better at defending rather than attacking.</b>

20:58.420 --> 21:02.130
<b>Those skills are all
because of your kindness.</b>

21:02.220 --> 21:06.510
<b>That kindness is ideal
for slaying a person.</b>

21:07.600 --> 21:09.970
<b>Here, take the stance like I told you.</b>

21:14.350 --> 21:18.110
<b>Are you praying to Buddha for help?</b>

21:18.610 --> 21:20.320
<b>It's useless, useless!</b>

21:20.400 --> 21:23.900
<b>Let me tell you a shocking fact.</b>

21:23.990 --> 21:28.330
<b>There is no such thing as Buddha!</b>

21:28.410 --> 21:31.330
<b><i>There's no need</i>
<i>to grip your sword in hatred.</i></b>

21:31.830 --> 21:35.000
<b><i>Instead, be like the bodhisattva</i>
<i>and handle it with compassion.</i></b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.960
<b>EPISODE 9 (YEAR OF 1334):
MY BUDDHA</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.960
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
